<tei:p><tei:pb n="744" ed="1949 lifecycle" facs="https://archive.org/download/PhilipBirnbaumHaSiddurHaShalemTheDailyPrayerBook1949/page/n768_medium.jpg"/><tei:milestone unit="prayer-part" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:asher_kiddesh_yedid"/>Blessed art thou, Lord our God, King of the universe, who didst sanctify beloved Israel from birth, impressing thy statute in his flesh and marking his descendants with the sign of the holy covenant. Because of this, for the sake of the covenant thou didst impress in our flesh, O eternal God, our Stronghold, deliver our dearly beloved from destruction. Blessed art thou, O Lord, Author of the covenant.<tei:milestone unit="prayer-part"/></tei:p>
